{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PasteKit 是一款讓用戶在支援自訂鍵盤的 App 中快速插入常用文字、地址、付款資料與圖片剪貼內容的鍵盤工具，適合每日重複回覆買家的網店賣家、分享報價與資料的自由工作者，以及處理常見問題的客服團隊。本次終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $7.99，內購限時免費。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-32.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>鍵盤插入常用回覆</h2>\n<p>用戶可把常用回覆、地址、付款資料與文字片段儲存一次，之後在支援自訂鍵盤的 App 內點選片段直接插入聊天或文字欄位；圖片片段則可先複製再貼上。鍵盤會記住分類、篩選、版面與捲動位置，並支援鍵盤內搜尋，亦可建立彩色分類、釘選常用片段及自行排序。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-43-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-44-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-45-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-46-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-47-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-48-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>PasteKit: Clipboard Keyboard 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PasteKit: Clipboard Keyboard</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6798929348\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:49.303867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":448,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T11:02:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:59:21.089678+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:24.909075+00:00","content_hash":"3a2d6e00283f42c22dbc921a819dc1f477c077426ba9c2ba511fd34276635275","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}